{"real": false, "dur": 58.63, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 1.94, "text": "Now the third step.", "words": [{"w": "Now", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "third", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "step.", "s": 1.55}]}, {"start": 2.29, "end": 5.37, "text": "Here are the two courses side by side.", "words": [{"w": "Here", "s": 2.29}, {"w": "are", "s": 2.67}, {"w": "the", "s": 3.06}, {"w": "two", "s": 3.44}, {"w": "courses", "s": 3.83}, {"w": "side", "s": 4.21}, {"w": "by", "s": 4.6}, {"w": "side.", "s": 4.98}]}, {"start": 5.72, "end": 9.56, "text": "French follows L’Atelier: a welcome unit, then four themed units.", "words": [{"w": "French", "s": 5.72}, {"w": "follows", "s": 6.1}, {"w": "L’Atelier:", "s": 6.48}, {"w": "a", "s": 6.87}, {"w": "welcome", "s": 7.25}, {"w": "unit,", "s": 7.64}, {"w": "then", "s": 8.02}, {"w": "four", "s": 8.41}, {"w": "themed", "s": 8.79}, {"w": "units.", "s": 9.18}]}, {"start": 9.91, "end": 12.6, "text": "You can see their French titles here.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 9.91}, {"w": "can", "s": 10.3}, {"w": "see", "s": 10.68}, {"w": "their", "s": 11.07}, {"w": "French", "s": 11.45}, {"w": "titles", "s": 11.83}, {"w": "here.", "s": 12.22}]}, {"start": 12.95, "end": 19.11, "text": "Chinese follows New Practical Chinese Reader, Book 1, with its fourteen lessons regrouped into five units.", "words": [{"w": "Chinese", "s": 12.95}, {"w": "follows", "s": 13.34}, {"w": "New", "s": 13.72}, {"w": "Practical", "s": 14.11}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 14.49}, {"w": "Reader,", "s": 14.88}, {"w": "Book", "s": 15.26}, {"w": "1,", "s": 15.65}, {"w": "with", "s": 16.03}, {"w": "its", "s": 16.42}, {"w": "fourteen", "s": 16.8}, {"w": "lessons", "s": 17.18}, {"w": "regrouped", "s": 17.57}, {"w": "into", "s": 17.95}, {"w": "five", "s": 18.34}, {"w": "units.", "s": 18.72}]}, {"start": 19.46, "end": 29.07, "text": "The French book names its situations, adds short workshops built around real documents, which it calls expression workshops, and ends each unit with a Mission.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 19.46}, {"w": "French", "s": 19.84}, {"w": "book", "s": 20.23}, {"w": "names", "s": 20.61}, {"w": "its", "s": 21.0}, {"w": "situations,", "s": 21.38}, {"w": "adds", "s": 21.77}, {"w": "short", "s": 22.15}, {"w": "workshops", "s": 22.53}, {"w": "built", "s": 22.92}, {"w": "around", "s": 23.3}, {"w": "real", "s": 23.69}, {"w": "documents,", "s": 24.07}, {"w": "which", "s": 24.46}, {"w": "it", "s": 24.84}, {"w": "calls", "s": 25.23}, {"w": "expression", "s": 25.61}, {"w": "workshops,", "s": 26.0}, {"w": "and", "s": 26.38}, {"w": "ends", "s": 26.77}, {"w": "each", "s": 27.15}, {"w": "unit", "s": 27.53}, {"w": "with", "s": 27.92}, {"w": "a", "s": 28.3}, {"w": "Mission.", "s": 28.69}]}, {"start": 29.42, "end": 34.04, "text": "For French, I mostly split up and sorted what was already there.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 29.42}, {"w": "French,", "s": 29.81}, {"w": "I", "s": 30.19}, {"w": "mostly", "s": 30.58}, {"w": "split", "s": 30.96}, {"w": "up", "s": 31.35}, {"w": "and", "s": 31.73}, {"w": "sorted", "s": 32.12}, {"w": "what", "s": 32.5}, {"w": "was", "s": 32.88}, {"w": "already", "s": 33.27}, {"w": "there.", "s": 33.65}]}, {"start": 34.39, "end": 37.08, "text": "The Chinese book has none of that.", "words": [{"w": "The", "s": 34.39}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 34.77}, {"w": "book", "s": 35.16}, {"w": "has", "s": 35.54}, {"w": "none", "s": 35.93}, {"w": "of", "s": 36.31}, {"w": "that.", "s": 36.7}]}, {"start": 37.43, "end": 40.89, "text": "So I have to write the Chinese situations myself.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 37.43}, {"w": "I", "s": 37.82}, {"w": "have", "s": 38.2}, {"w": "to", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "write", "s": 38.97}, {"w": "the", "s": 39.35}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 39.74}, {"w": "situations", "s": 40.12}, {"w": "myself.", "s": 40.51}]}, {"start": 41.24, "end": 43.17, "text": "Twenty-six of them in total.", "words": [{"w": "Twenty-six", "s": 41.24}, {"w": "of", "s": 41.63}, {"w": "them", "s": 42.01}, {"w": "in", "s": 42.4}, {"w": "total.", "s": 42.78}]}, {"start": 43.52, "end": 50.44, "text": "Lessons 6 and 14 are review lessons, so I use those as the basis for the final tasks.", "words": [{"w": "Lessons", "s": 43.52}, {"w": "6", "s": 43.9}, {"w": "and", "s": 44.28}, {"w": "14", "s": 44.67}, {"w": "are", "s": 45.05}, {"w": "review", "s": 45.44}, {"w": "lessons,", "s": 45.82}, {"w": "so", "s": 46.21}, {"w": "I", "s": 46.59}, {"w": "use", "s": 46.98}, {"w": "those", "s": 47.36}, {"w": "as", "s": 47.75}, {"w": "the", "s": 48.13}, {"w": "basis", "s": 48.52}, {"w": "for", "s": 48.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 49.28}, {"w": "final", "s": 49.67}, {"w": "tasks.", "s": 50.05}]}, {"start": 50.79, "end": 54.25, "text": "For the other units, I write the tasks too.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 50.79}, {"w": "the", "s": 51.17}, {"w": "other", "s": 51.56}, {"w": "units,", "s": 51.94}, {"w": "I", "s": 52.33}, {"w": "write", "s": 52.71}, {"w": "the", "s": 53.1}, {"w": "tasks", "s": 53.48}, {"w": "too.", "s": 53.87}]}, {"start": 54.6, "end": 57.68, "text": "Let me show you what that looks like.", "words": [{"w": "Let", "s": 54.6}, {"w": "me", "s": 54.98}, {"w": "show", "s": 55.37}, {"w": "you", "s": 55.75}, {"w": "what", "s": 56.14}, {"w": "that", "s": 56.52}, {"w": "looks", "s": 56.91}, {"w": "like.", "s": 57.29}]}]}